<title>JAPAN: Moody's upgrades Nanto Bank's debt ratings.</title>
<headline>Moody's upgrades Nanto Bank's debt ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday that it had upgraded its short- and long-term deposit ratings for Nanto Bank to Prime-2 and Baa1 respectively, from Prime-3 and Baa2.</p>
<p>It said it had also raised the bank's Bank Financial Strength Rating (BFSR) to D from E+.</p>
</text>
